 Maika's grandfather."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He became the school's principal after starting up several businesses."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He also provides support to child welfare facilities and is known as a philanthropist. He has many connections in the political and business worlds."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He is usually gentle, but he hates crookedness and has a stubborn side."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Perhaps because of this, he has many enemies."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"For this reason, he keeps the fact that Maika is his granddaughter a secret from those around him."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from the official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c90587"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/64/6495dd953aff5613804923fcae5c7a275326a199f2fc34f5b1a27d0d69246361.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/44/4411ad56cb4e87c0a801c942ef57922d5b50e0738bd4fb2fb6a6af106f7743c9.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]}],"songs":[],"companies":[{"companyId":"egs:brand:91","sourceCompanyId":"egs:brand:91","canonicalEntityId":"egs:brand:91","name":"Guilty","roleCodes":["brand"],"identityStatus":"ambiguous-shared-work-review","relationId":"egs:work-brand:36779:91","source":"egs"},{"companyId":"vndb:p15756","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p15756","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p15756","name":"SVN","roleCodes":["publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:126764:v28268","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p115","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p115","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p115","name":"Guilty","roleCodes":["developer","publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:79492:v28268","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p115","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p115","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p115","name":"Guilty","roleCodes":["develop